factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 3 problems
  The reel_script says the fishing net centre is opened by the Central government's fisheries department directly rather than being arranged by the cooperative society; the draft says 'இதை ஏற்பாடு செய்துள்ளது' referring to the fisheries department funding, which is roughly accurate, but the sentence 'குளித்தலை அருகே கட்டளை காவிரி ஆறு முதல் திருச்சி மாவட்டம் முக்கொம்பு வரை உள்ள சங்கத்தினருக்கு இந்த மையம் உதவும்' omits that the benefit is specifically for the cooperative's members, and the reel_script's claim that the 'Central government fisheries department' organized it is a mixing of funder and organizer roles.
  The slides_spec line 'மத்திய அரசின் மீன்வளத் துறை நிதி உதவியுடன் நடைபெற்றது' ties the event to the fisheries department but the article says the cooperative society organized it with funds from that department, so the sentence mixes the funder and the organiser.
  The reel_script omits the key fact that the event was an opening ceremony where the centre was inaugurated with a ribbon cut by the deputy director; it instead says the centre was 'திறக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது' without the ribbon-cutting detail being fully linked to the opening, which is acceptable, but the sentence 'இதை ஏற்பாடு செய்துள்ளது' is ambiguous as to what 'இதை' refers to.
