factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 3 problems
  The reel_script says the centre is for fishermen 'who sell nets at low prices' and the headline/slides say it sells nets, but the article says it is a sales centre; the claim that nets are provided 'for members' is a slight restatement but not a new fact.
  The reel_script states the low-price nets are provided to members 'from Kattalai Cauvery river to Mukkombu' and the phrase 'உறுப்பினர்களுக்கு இந்த மையத்தில்' implies the centre serves the whole Mukkombu stretch, which the article only says about the association's members on the southern side of Cauvery river; the 'southern part of Cauvery river' detail is dropped from the reel_script and slides_spec.
  The slides_spec line 'குறைந்த விலையில் மீன்பிடி உபகரணங்கள் வழங்கப்படும்' and 'ஆயிரத்துக்கு மேற்பட்ட உறுப்பினர்களுக்கு வலைகள்' are not wrong, but the caption and reel_script merge the location range into a single statement about all members, which mixes two facts (location of recipients and membership count).
