factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The article says the lamp sale took place in Karur, but the draft's reel_script and slides_spec describe the sale as 'ஜோராக' and do not add any invented facts; however, the draft's slides_spec line 'நேற்று விற்பனை ஜோராக நடந்தது' is consistent with the article, so no issue there.
  The reel_script says 'இதனால் களிமண் விளக்குகள் மற்றும் பல வண்ணங்களில் உள்ள சிலிகான் விளக்குகள் அதிகம் விற்பனையாகின' — the article does not say the lamps sold 'more' (அதிகம்) because of the festival; this is an invented causal claim.
  The reel_script says 'அன்று மாலையில்' (on that evening) for the lamp lighting, which is consistent, but the caption's 'அன்று மாலை வீடுகள், வணிக நிறுவனங்கள், கோவில்களில்' is also consistent; no problem there.
  The slides_spec hl2 'ரூ.2 முதல் ரூ.100 வரை' combines the small and large lamp prices into one range, which is a mixing of two different price facts into one headline line.
